{"id":"marchand","lemma":"marchand","pos":"adj","rank":3494,"glosses":["merchant; mercantile"],"ipa":"/maʁ.ʃɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/74/Fr-marchand.ogg/Fr-marchand.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"marchande","masculinePlural":"marchands","femininePlural":"marchandes"},"formAudio":{"marchande":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-marchande.wav","marchands":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/18/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-marchands.wav","marchandes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-marchandes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je suis un marchand.","en":"I'm a merchant.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il est marchand de grains.","en":"He deals in grain.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"grain","l":"grain"}]},{"text":"J'ai acheté une bouteille de bière au marchand de vin.","en":"I bought a bottle of beer at the liquor store.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to purchase","l":"acheter"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bottle"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"beer"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"wine"}]},{"text":"Cette galerie marchande est fermée aujourd'hui.","en":"This department store is closed today.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"gallery"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"closed","l":"fermé"},null,{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Les pirates se sont emparés d'un navire marchand.","en":"The pirates captured a merchant ship.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"pirate","l":"pirate"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"ship"},null]}]}